{"server":"jp","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_04_end","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_04","title":"女将","storyCode":"WR-4","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"a09b69cd8ac9b941a9898c546f1dbeeda7d530a7d3229d68439e07434c2ab8bf","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"少女を連れて逃げたウユウは、どうにかクルースとの合流に成功。一方、サガ、レイ、ラヴァの三人は、しばらく質屋に隠れていた。どうやら店主のレイは何かを知っている様子だった。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"うう、ううぅ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"お嬢ちゃん、ほら空が明るくなってきたよ。もうかなり歩いてきただろう？　もうすぐ着くから、泣かないでおくれ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"ううっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"大丈夫、お兄ちゃんがついてるから、安全だよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"あぁ……いい子だから泣かないで。もう庭園は見えているよ。あと少しで到着するから。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガアッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"いやあぁ――！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"ど、どうしてこんなところにいるんだ！　こいつらは太陽を怖がるはずじゃなかったのか！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"くそっ！　お嬢ちゃん、おぶってあげるから、しっかりつかまっていてくれ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガアッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"おじさん！　おじさん急いで！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"か、髪の毛を引っ張らないでくれ！　メガネが、メガネが落ちる！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ガァッ！　グァッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"……ウユウくん、逃げ足だけは本当に速いなぁ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"英雄さん、何かおっしゃいましたか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"ん～？　何でもないよぉ。あなたたちは早く庭園に隠れてねぇ。外の警備は私に任せて〜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"うーん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"あの小さな墨魎は、普通のオリジムシなんかよりもすばしっこいみたいだけど……どんどんウユウくんに離されてるねぇ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"まさか追いつけないほどウユウくんが速いのぉ？　そんなことってあるぅ？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"ガッ……ガァ……ガァ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"くらえ！　えい！　はっ！　やぁっ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"ははっ！　どうだ？　これで追いつけないだろう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガッ！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"おじさん！　もっと速く走れないの！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"これ前からやってみたかったんだ。映画のカンフースターたちは、路地で追いかけられるときに、必ず何かを投げるからね！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"い、いいから！　もっと速く走って！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"痛っ！　頭を叩かないでくれよ、私は駄獣じゃないんだから！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガウッ――！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"回り込んできた！？　太陽があんなに眩しいのにどうしたんだ！　こいつらは光を恐れるんじゃなかったのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"た、助けて！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ！　仕方ない……お嬢ちゃん、先に逃げるんだ。私が――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"ガッ！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"ガ……ガ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"……クルース嬢！？　ああ～恩人様、助けられるんならもっと早く助けてくださいよ――って、どこにいるんです？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"ここだよぉ～。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"わっ……！　お、お姉ちゃん、どこから出てきたの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"さすが非凡なる狙撃の名手、神出鬼没かつ軽やかな身のこなし、真に――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"お姉ちゃん！　おじさんを助けてくれてありがとう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"うっ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"早くお家に戻ってねぇ、お母さんがずっと探してたよぉ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"うん！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人様、早くラヴァ嬢とお坊様を助けに行った方がよろしいかと。ここは私が守りますのでご安心ください。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"あれぇ……？　さっきラヴァちゃんに、必ず助けに戻るって誓いを立ててなかったぁ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"お、恩人様はなんと恐ろしい地獄耳……ああいや、素晴らしい聴力をお持ちで……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"別にそんなことないよぉ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"ところでその扇子、どうしていつも手に握ってるのぉ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"や、これは必需品でして。私の一番のお気に入りです。恩師からの贈り物でもありますし、片時も手放したくないんですよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"それに……へへ、手に扇子を持っていれば、何となく文化人っぽいでしょう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"ふうん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"さっきの墨魎は、どうしてここまで来て平気だったのかなぁ？　ここはもうお昼だよねぇ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"それはこっちが聞きたいです！　あいつに追いかけ回されて本当に疲れ果てましたよ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"うーん……まぁ、まずはラヴァちゃんと合流しよぉ～。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_pawnshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……静かになったな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"ここは夜の端で、明かりもわずかに見えるだけだっていうのに、どうして化け物が襲ってこないんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"それは拙僧も不思議に思っておった……今までこんなに静かだったことはないぞ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レイ","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"静かなのは、良いことでしょう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"む！　いかにも。これで拙僧もようやく一息つけるでござる！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"よっこらしょっと。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レイ","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"気をつけて。店の物を壊さないでね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"サガ、さっき言ってたシーウ……というのは？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"もちろん『夕娥（シーウ）、月に奔る』の美談に登場する夕娥のことだが？　ああ、拙僧は今でも彼女の両の瞳を忘れられぬ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……？？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レイ","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"サガ、もっと順を追ってゆっくり話してあげたら？　ラヴァさんの顔がどんどん曇っていってるわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"お、すまぬすまぬ、つい興奮してしまった。さっきは墨魎と戦い、ラヴァ殿もくたびれたであろう？　ここで茶でも飲みながらゆっくり話さぬか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レイ","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃあ私はお茶を入れてきますね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ、先に聞きたいことがあるのだが、レイ殿はここから出る方法を知っておるであろう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レイ","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"いいえ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"知らぬのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レイ","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"（軽く首を横に振る）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"講談師","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["ラヴァ"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["サガ"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["ウユウ","墨魎"]}]}
